window.products.push({"id":403273,"name":"UCO Aluminum Mini Candle Lantern Plus A Package of 6 Refill Candles!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412lIlxD0jL._AC_.jpg","description":"The worldwide popularity of the tealight tub candle inspired us to create a lantern to make its use safe and convenient. The design of the Mini Lantern does a superb job of utilizing a readily available candle and expanding its capabilities to include outdoor recreation and wider use around the home. Made to the same high standards as the Original Candle Lantern, the patented Mini-Lantern features aluminum construction, a glass chimney, and a unique candle holder that keeps the tealight candle stable. A specially designed vent in the base of the lantern provides cool air to supply the flame with needed oxygen. The UCO Mini Lantern is ideal for ultra light hiking, bike touring, world travel, and makes home use of the ubiquitous tealight candle much more appealing. Six refill candles are included in this package.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412lIlxD0jL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UCO","source_asin":"B0089H00BK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-403273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0089H00BK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0089H00BK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
