window.products.push({"id":403284,"name":"Mexican Alebrije Cat Wood Carving Handcrafted Sculpture (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91i-o3l8vUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Incredible cat wood carving made by Margarita Sosa and her daughter Gabriela, who have been making carvings for 20 years in the town of San Martin Tilcajete in Oaxaca, birthplace of Alebrijes. This beautiful unique one-piece sculpture was carved out of copal tree wood & painted with perfect detail. Place this stellar Alebrije Cat in a place of prominence in your home and enjoy the exclamations and gasps when people see it. The Mexican Alebrijes of Oaxaca are remarkable and irresistible representations of animals both real and imaginary decorated with flowers, other animals, geometrical designs and color; lots of color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91i-o3l8vUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alkimia Inc","source_asin":"B07FF9V2NZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-403284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FF9V2NZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FF9V2NZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
