window.products.push({"id":403310,"name":"Calphalon One Infused Anodized 9-Inch Chef's Skillet with Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21FAYCB679L._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Infused Anodized Cookware Calphalon One is revolutionary hybrid cookware that combines the best qualities of traditional metal and nonstick cooking surfaces. Calphalon One lets you sear, sauce, and cook exactly the way you want without sticking, staining or tough clean-up. By means of an exclusive, breakthrough anodization process, interior and exterior surfaces of the pans are infused with an advanced release polymer. Unlike nonstick coatings that simply sit on top of metal, this material actually penetrates below the surface, into the pores of the metal. The infused anodized cooking surface offers superb durability and versatility in the kitchen. Exceptional searing Heavy-gauge, highly conductive Calphalon One sears foods quickly and evenly. Meats and poultry brown and develop rich flavor and texture on the cookwares infused anodized surface. Browned bits on the bottom of the pan (called \"fond\") form readily. Calphalon One is ideal for deglazing and making pan sauces. Extreme durability Use any utensils you like--including metal--when cooking with Calphalon One. The infused anodized cooking surface wont scratch or peel. Crafted from heavy-gauge aluminum, Calphalon One withstands high temperatures without warping. Pans feature flared rims for extra strength, too. Cooking versatility Calphalon One is ideal for virtually any kitchen and any cooking technique you can name. Its compatible with gas, electric, and ceramic stovetops and safe for use in both the oven and the broiler. Easy, reliable release Infused with an advanced release polymer, the Calphalon One cooking lets you control when foods release from the bottom of the pan. Youll experience considerably less sticking with Calphalon One than with traditional metal cooking surfaces--and youll cook with more confidence. Quick clean-up Hot, soapy water and a dish cloth--thats all you need to keep Calphalon One sparkling clean. The infused anodized cooking surface releases foods as easily during clean-up as it does while you cook. To keep your cookware looking new, occasionally clean it with a Scotch Brite pad and Barkeepers Friend cleanser. Classic vessel shapes Like the classic French cookware that inspired its shapes, Calphalon One vessels are designed to deliver optimal results with specific cooking techniques. Calphalon One is constructed from heavy-gauge aluminum and features flared rims for protection against wear and tear and to facilitate pouring. Ergonomic handles and contrasting stainless-steel covers bring both greater versatility and beautiful style to the cookware. Cool comfort handles Triple-riveted and ergonomically balanced, the contoured handle stays comfortably cool for stovetop cooking. The stainless-steel handles are carefully balanced and proportioned to make cooking with every Calphalon One pan comfortable and convenient. Resists Stains Calphalon One cookware offers stain resistance to even the toughest foods. Both interior and exterior surfaces of the cookware are infused anodized to resist staining and make cleanup even easier. Lifetime warranty Calphalon One Infused Anodized cookware is covered by a Lifetime Warranty. Calphalon will repair or replace any item found defective in material or workmanship when put to normal household use and cared for according to instructions. Minor imperfections, surface markings as a result of shipping, and slight color variations are normal. This excludes damage from misuse or abuse, such as improper cleaning, overheating, dishwasher use, use of caustic or other unapproved cleaners, neglect, accident, alteration, fire, theft, or use in commercial establishments. Before You Cook Wash your new pan and cover in hot, sudsy water. Rinse and dry. Do not season your pan before using it. To enjoy optimum performance from your Calphalon cookware, keep it scrupulously clean. Any kind of oily residue on your pan can cause foods to stick. Heat Settings Use a lower heat setting than you normally would. Calphalon cookware heats and cools more quickly than other cookware because it's made of heavy-gauge aluminum. It's important to use the right heat setting for the cooking method you're using. Experiment to find the right heat settings on your stove. High heat for boiling or reducing liquids only. High heat for boiling or reducing liquids only. Medium to medium-high heat for sautéing, stir frying, and frying. Medium to medium-high heat for sautéing, stir frying, and frying. Low heat for warming food, simmering, and preparing delicate sauces. Stove-Top Use When sautéing, stir-frying or frying, always preheat the pan at the temperature setting you'll use to cook. Preheating provides maximum control. The pan is properly preheated when the rim is hot-to-the-touch. Do not preheat on high. For cooking techniques such as sautéing, stir frying, or preparing an omelet, preheat at medium to medium-high. Oven & Broiler Use Infused anodized pans can be used in the oven and under the broiler. They","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21FAYCB679L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Calphalon","source_asin":"B00015N60A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-403310","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00015N60A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00015N60A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":403311,"name":"100% Waterproof 2 in 1 Mattress Protector and Mattress Pad - Quilted Fitted Down Alternative Mattress Pad Cover, Waterproof Membrane, GOTS Certified B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":180.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61djq0obYSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our plush siliconized micro fiberfill mattress pad provides you with a heavenly sleeping experience. It has been made with loft microfiber down-alternative fill that fluffs incredibly to give you a cozy feel and most relaxing sleep. The cover is made of 100% Certified organic cotton fabric that gives superior comfort against your skin. Box quilting looks elegant while keeping fill even and smooth. Stretch skirting with deep-pocket design and durable elastic creates a smooth, secure fit. With this mattress pad, you can protect your mattress, change the softness or firmness, or give yourself an extra layer of luxury to sleep on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61djq0obYSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delara","source_asin":"B0BQ9RWQ24","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-403311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ9RWQ24","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ9RWQ24","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":403312,"name":"always4u 100% Blackout Soft Velvet Curtains for Bedroom Living Room Thermal Energy Saving 84 Inches Long Luxury Gold Foil Print Drapes 2 Panels Wild R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jdH4eZXEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NICE DESIGN: These soft and sumptuous velvet curtains will reflect light to give a glimmering effect. The pattern will be more exquisite in the sunlight. 100% Blackout Curtains: The blackout liner is particularly lightweight due to the patent innovative technology, 90g/㎡ blackout liner is softer and thinner than traditional one. It can provide you with a 100% dark environment. Quality Fabric: The best quality fabric on the market, no wrinkled, neat seams,trimmed neatly edge. Give your space an instant update with flawless cut velvet curtains. PACKAGE INCLUDE: Two panels per package, each panel measures 52 W by 84 L, total size is 104 W x 84 L inch. The product may have a slight color difference due to light and monitor. Cleaning instruction: Dry cleaning is preferred; if machine washed, please clean separately and wash at a temperature below 30℃ with the gentle cycle minimum speed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jdH4eZXEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"always4u","source_asin":"B099K27KKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-403312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099K27KKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099K27KKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":403313,"name":"Logovision Black Panther Wakanda Forever Stainless Steel Tumbler 30 oz Coffee Travel Cup, Vacuum Insulated & Double Wall with Leakproof Sliding Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XBUhB2RxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DESIGNED FOR THE DAILY GRIND – Our secure vacuum insulated travel tumbler features an easy-open sliding lid design, so you can enjoy your favorite beverage on the go. Durable AS plastic lid construction keeps your drink fresher longer. QUALITY & PERFORMANCE – Seamlessly crafted from premium food grade 18/8 powder-coated stainless steel, our sweat proof BPA Free tumbler keeps drinks hot for up to 6 hours, cold for 12 hours, and is always and cool to the touch. TRAVEL FRIENDLY – At 7.9 inches high with a lip diameter of 4.2 inches, our 30 oz Double Wall Tumbler is sized to fit in most standard sized cup holders making it ideal for your daily commute to school or work. A leakproof gasket keeps the spills at bay no matter where your journey takes you. HAND WASH & EASY TO CLEAN - Due to our unique printing process our tumbler must be hand washed. The dual flip lid can be easily disassembled for quick and thorough cleaning. Not dishwasher safe. OFFICIALLY LICENSED & PRINTED IN USA - Each of our designs are officially licensed and 100% authentic. Our fan-favored imagery is created by our brilliant in-house team of graphic artists, and is often hand-drawn and illustrated, adding unique detailing to each design. Printed-on-Demand for you in our high-tech printing facility in Detroit, MI.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XBUhB2RxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Logovision","source_asin":"B09WHYYD2D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-403313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WHYYD2D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WHYYD2D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
