window.products.push({"id":403457,"name":"Boho Floral Kitchen Rug Set of 2 Colorful Flowers Anti Fatigue Non-Slip Kitchen Floor Mats Comfort Standing Bohemian Mat Waterproof Farmhouse Sink Lau","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1pWNParQoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Package & Size】Two piece of anti-fatigue pvc kitchen mat. Measures 17.3 x 28in +17.3 x 47in.These can creates a perfect support and softness for standing, helps reducing your ankle fatigue and ache while cooking or doing laundry.Each piece is 1cm (0.4 inch) thick. 【Non-Skid】This boho floral cushioned kitchen mat carpets has texture-design surface, rubber non-slip rubber backing and unique beveled edges will prevent people from slipping or falling giving you that peace of mind, perfect for homes with pets or kids.Please keep bottom of mat dry so that achieve a better non-slip effect. 【Unique Design Theme】The bohemian flower unique print surface design is noticeable and interesting,adds a stunning decorative element to your home, really impressive.And the color matching of yellow and green is very suitable for the decoration of the farmhouse.It is not only a floor mat, but also a functional household necessity.Fashion element kitchen mat, let you love life and enjoy life. 【Multiple Uses Floor Type】These mandala flower kitchen rugs will not make your door into trouble, can be used under the kitchen, home, office table and chairs.Suitable for most indoor floor types, including laminate, marble, tiles, hardwood and carpet. Great for Kitchen sink floor, Laundry room, Bathroom vanity, Restaurant kitchen, Kids toy room. 【Easy to Clean】These vintage colorful kitchen runner rug sets are waterproof, durable, oil resistant, simply wipe clean with a damp cloth or sponge, use any common household cleaner or sweep clean of dirt and dust, save your time and energy.If the kitchen standing mats you received has a crease on the back (crease is caused by the packaging method), don’t worry this is not a quality issue. Just spread out the kitchen mat and lay it flat and the crease will disappear after a few days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1pWNParQoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qahing","source_asin":"B0C5WQBW2W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-403457","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5WQBW2W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5WQBW2W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
