window.products.push({"id":403530,"name":"Smuggle Mug Shampoo, Umbrella & Sunscreen Flask Lid Seals | 24-Pack 24mm | Leak-Proof | Keep Your Hidden Beverages Secure | Perfect Cruise Companion","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UvfDWsxkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For extra protection from leaks and random searches use these ShampBooze Flask/Umbrella Flask or Sunscreen Flask/Lotion Flask lid safety seals. They are one more barrier from the security finding out what's really inside your stealth flask. Choose the size and quantity that fits you best. Just simply push one in your bottle lid, writing towards the lid top, and screw on tight. The seals are pressure sensitive to they will stick to the opening of your bottle tight. When ready to open, unscrew the lid and peel off the seal and enjoy. Using the seals along with ShampBooze saves the average cruiser over $180 off their cruise bar tab and $100 at the pool or festival with the Sunscreen Flask or Lotion Flask. Its simply the best way to sneak alcohol/booze safely. See Smuggle Mug for other great hidden flasks. 24 count comes with Free can cooozie.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UvfDWsxkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smuggle Mug","source_asin":"B01LYCHEVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-403530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LYCHEVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LYCHEVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
