window.products.push({"id":403852,"name":"immtree Sherpa Fleece Weighted Blanket 15lbs for Adult, Soft Flannel Shaggy Cozy Fuzzy Fluffy Heavy Hug Blanket, Dual Sided Sofa Bedding Bed Sofa Blan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t2y-TUJCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Personalized Double-sided Design: immtree Sherpa double-sided fleece weighted blanket is made of smooth flannel on the front, matched with the fluffy sherpa design on the back. This soft flannel shaggy heavy blanket is more soft and skin-friendly than pure cotton weighted blanket, it has a stronger sense of wrapping, allowing you to enter a peaceful sleep. Internal Structure: Fluffy weighted blanket with 7-layer design: the outermost layer is flannel and sherpa made of ultra-fine polyester fiber, and the filling is safe and environmentally friendly ceramic beads. There are two additional layers of fabric in the middle to wrap the ceramic beads to isolate the noise caused by the rolling of the ceramic beads. The surface of the bed weighted blanket is a uniform small square, which evenly fixes the ceramic beads in a specific position. Choose the Right Size for You: We recommend that the weight of the blanket you choose is about 8%-10% of the user's weight. 12 pounds is suitable for people weighing 110-150 pounds; 15 pounds is suitable for people weighing 150-190 pounds; 20 pounds is suitable for people weighing 190-250 pounds. Easy to Care: This cozy fuzzy fluffy weighted blanket doesn’t require an additional removable duvet cover, saving you the cost of buying a quilt cover. Don't have to worry about it being difficult to clean. When the weighted blanket is locally contaminated, you can use partial cleaning. If you have to clean it as a whole after long time use, you can put the heavy blanket in a commercial washing machine and then dry it at low temperature. Worry-free Customer Service: We endeavor to provide the best quality products to our customers.You will enjoy a 30-day refund & return policy and a lifetime warranty. If you have any question with the purchase, please contact us,we will actively deal with the problems for you within 24 hoursand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81t2y-TUJCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"immtree","source_asin":"B08R9NPZZ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-403852","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R9NPZZ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R9NPZZ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
