window.products.push({"id":403995,"name":"600 Thread Count King Size Striped Sheet Set - 100% Cotton Damask Sheets - Silky & Soft Like Egyptian Cotton - Deep Pocket Sateen Weave 4Pc Bed Sheets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712ZyPKNR9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ 100% COTTON STRIPED SHEETS THAT ARE SMOOTH & SILKY: Experience the luxurious comfort of ivory striped sheets that lend elegance and richness to a bedroom. Made from Extra Long-Staple Cotton and sateen weave, these 600 THREAD COUNT Cotton Sheets are buttery smooth, crisp, and thick, like the Egyptian quality cotton sheets in five-star hotels. These cotton damask sheets keep you cool and breathable and are the best choice for every season. ✔ FITS YOUR MATTRESS & PILLOWS PERFECTLY: Our 4 Piece King Size DAMASK Sheets Set has 1 Flat Sheet (102” W x 108” L), 1 Fitted Sheet (78” W x 80” L + 15\" deep pocket), and 2 Pillowcases (20” W x 40” L). The fitted bedsheet has deep pockets to keep the sheet in the place. The pillow cases fit over the pillows and the fitted sheet snug well on both low-foam and tall mattresses. What’s better? The smart tags help to make the sheets neatly, the way you have never seen before! ✔ EASY TO WASH, EASY TO CARE: We recommend washing our pure damask cotton sheets in warm water and tumble dry on low mode. Our king size damask sheets don’t pill, shrink, or fade even after washing multiple times. The soft fabric opens up with every wash and makes the sheets smoother and silkier. Remember to promptly remove the damask bed sheets from the dryer after the wash and fold them to avoid wrinkles. ✔ CERTIFIED, DURABLE, AND ECO-FRIENDLY: These damask stripe king size sheets are CERTIFIED as STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX&reg to be FREE from Harmful Chemicals and Artificial Synthetics. Our cotton sheets are naturally-sourced, sustainable, and earth-friendly, unlike microfiber and other fabrics that damage the environment and are not ideal for people with sensitive skin. ✔ YOUR SATISFACTION IS OUR PRIORITY #1: Don’t like our damask striped sheets? No worries. Reach out to us and we will make up to you. We can issue a replacement or refund—whatever you like. Love ‘em? Great. Our ivory damask sheets set is also a GREAT GIFT for women and men on festive occasions such asMother’s Day, Father’s Day, Women’s Day, Men’s Day, Christmas, Valentine’s Day, Halloween, Weddings, Vacations, and Autumn Holidays","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712ZyPKNR9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B08549X63L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-403995","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08549X63L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08549X63L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
